{"title":"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 11","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The coordinates of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70f47290d3c991aac723270e49b5415eb82b2cc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, as shown. After which of these translations will <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> move to the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80af93825ca4856e6a6702effe938090a6435dde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/2/862953825090932391ed5f9726267800db0723cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{right } 9, \\text{ down } 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{left } 5, \\text{ up } 6 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{right } 6, \\text{ down } 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{left } 6, \\text{ down } 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{right } 5, \\text{ down } 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"842\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70f47290d3c991aac723270e49b5415eb82b2cc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80af93825ca4856e6a6702effe938090a6435dde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa17d01e2fa6f7b7b6ce4af99c9cd1c005823e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 - 2 = 5$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> would have to move <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units to the right.\n</p><p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70f47290d3c991aac723270e49b5415eb82b2cc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80af93825ca4856e6a6702effe938090a6435dde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/d/f5dd2b1c7578cf682384911af91836ffbe673e13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 - 6 = -6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"90\" height=\"15\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> would have to move <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units down.\n</p><p>Thus, the translation would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c09fc4fc2ff5254450bace6829b59f8ccca13a4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } \\text{right } 5, \\text{ down } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"163\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28answer_choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(answer_choices)\">Solution 2 (answer choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (answer choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />-distance from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/f/70f47290d3c991aac723270e49b5415eb82b2cc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80af93825ca4856e6a6702effe938090a6435dde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7, 0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/a/1fa17d01e2fa6f7b7b6ce4af99c9cd1c005823e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 - 2 = 5$\" width=\"73\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> would have to move <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units to the right. The only answer choice that includes this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/9/c09fc4fc2ff5254450bace6829b59f8ccca13a4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } \\text{right } 5, \\text{ down } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"163\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2025 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resou